  "enforcement": [
    "Backend derives scope from the session, never from a client-supplied id. A mismatched owner id or unit id is 403, not an empty list.",
    "Fields marked scope none are omitted from the serialised response for that role.",
    "Navigation is built from the session permission list: unreachable destinations are removed, not disabled.",
    "A visible-but-not-editable value renders the permission microcopy pattern: restriction plus route.",
    "Every action on a resource flagged financial or sensitive writes an audit_log entry with actor, before and after state.",
    "Revealing an access credential is itself an auditable action, even though it is only a read."
  ]
